irl I Like","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2016-07-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Joonyoung is intent on winning Eul's heart. He runs into Jitae while visiting Eul and begins to sense something suspicious about Jitae.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jlZslAwlf7HPxPxS2eYAPPasMcQ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9VbmNvbnRyb2xsYWJseS1Gb25kLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.9","title":"Tell Dad the Truth","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2016-08-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With everyone thinking Joonyoung is dating Kim Yoona, Eul continues to shoot her documentary. Jitae urges his mom to tell Dad the truth about everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ysZ1OE1OjVIIQoC89WHo349Nv0K.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9VbmNvbnRyb2xsYWJseS1Gb25kLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.10","title":"Shin Joon-young Saved Him","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2016-08-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After a phone argument with his mom, Joonyoung ditches the K-Pop Festival and spots Eul driving a van, speeding toward Choi Hyeonjoon.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4Po6VjvTwrX8OC55WTtrqXZW4tl.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9VbmNvbnRyb2xsYWJseS1Gb25kLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.11","title":"Don't Give In to Shin Joon-young's Threat","season":1,"episode":11,"released":"2016-08-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Jitae asks his father to release Eul. Joonyoung tells his mom about the things Hyeonjoon did to Eul years ago and why he quit law school.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nGKq1tuRWQNuh4Xsq6cyrG3a2gj.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9VbmNvbnRyb2xsYWJseS1Gb25kLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.12","title":"Let's Give Up","season":1,"episode":12,"released":"2016-08-11T00:0